---
export const title = 'Usage';
export const order = 100;
import DemoComponentCard from '../../../../components/DemoComponentCard.astro';
---

<p>
  <code>wc-transfer-list</code> chooses several items from a long list: roles for a user, columns
  for a report, members of a group. Items come from <code>options</code>
  (<code>{'{ value, label, description?, disabled? }'}</code>); the ones in the "Selected" list are
  the value. Check items and press an arrow button to move them, or press <kbd>Enter</kbd> or
  double-click to move one item.
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
  <wc-transfer-list
    id='transfer-list-demo'
    label='Roles'
    name='roles'
    value='viewer'
    helper-text='Owner is always assigned'
    style='width: 100%; max-width: 44rem;'
    options='[{"value":"owner","label":"Owner","disabled":true},{"value":"admin","label":"Administrator","description":"Full access"},{"value":"editor","label":"Editor","description":"Can change content"},{"value":"viewer","label":"Viewer"},{"value":"billing","label":"Billing"},{"value":"auditor","label":"Auditor"}]'
  ></wc-transfer-list>
  <script is:inline>
    document.querySelector('#transfer-list-demo').addEventListener('change', function (event) {
      myConsole.log('change', JSON.stringify(event.detail.values));
    });
  </script>
</DemoComponentCard>

<p>
  Disabled options stay where they are, so a disabled option in the value is locked in. The
  headlines default to "Available" and "Selected"; change them with
  <code>available-headline</code> and <code>selected-headline</code>. The move buttons, counts
  and announcements use them.
</p>

<h3>When to use something else</h3>
<ul>
  <li>A short list: <code>wc-listbox multiple</code> or <code>wc-checkbox-group</code>.</li>
  <li>A compact form field: <code>wc-select multiple</code>.</li>
</ul>
